<TD WIDTH="4%"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">b.</FONT></TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The offering and sale of the Shares are being made pursuant to the Registration Statement and the Prospectus (as such terms are defined below). The Purchaser
acknowledges that the Corporation intends to enter into a purchase agreement with certain underwriters pursuant to which it intends to offer and sell (the &#147;<U>Offering</U>&#148;) up to an aggregate of&nbsp;<U>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</U>shares
of its Common Stock to the public pursuant to the Registration Statement and Prospectus. </FONT></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
