<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">When issued and paid for pursuant to the terms hereof, the Shares to be sold hereunder by the Corporation will be validly issued and outstanding, fully paid and
non-assessable shares of Common Stock, free and clear of all liens and free of any preemptive or similar rights. </FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

